          "type": "text",
          "text": "Field researchers considered restricted transport access while preparing a capacity check for the school science exhibit. The exhibit will be moved between classrooms on a wheeled trolley. A scale model will be stored with the project documentation. A cone of height 21 cm is filled to one eighth of its full volume. The liquid forms a smaller similar cone at the tip. Find the liquid depth in cm."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
        "canonical_answer": "10",
        "canonical_latex": "10",
        "accepted_answers": [],
        "absolute_tolerance": null,
        "rounding_precision": null,
        "unit": null
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "stage": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For similar solids, the volume ratio is the cube of the length ratio."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The cube root of 1/8 is 1/2; apply this to the height."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Select the relevant dimensions and apply the mensuration relationship."
            },
            {
              "type": "display_math",
              "latex": "\\left(\\frac{h}{21}\\right)^3=\\frac18\\Rightarrow h=10"
            }
          ],
